 ## 2026-11-18
+- **Improved:** Auto edits can now cut only where the footage gives a reason: a real camera change or the end of a sentence. Before, clips were sliced into equal pieces, with zooms every few seconds and cuts snapped to the background music. Zooms now need speech behind them, and decorative transitions only land on real camera changes. Off until approved: set `EDL_CONTENT_CUTS=on` to try it. ([#TBD](https://github.com/FujiwaraChoki/supoclip/pulls))
 - **New:** Auto clips no longer all sound the same once the extended library is installed (one command, checked file by file). Each music mood then has a library of free tracks, and each sound-effect cue has many variants. Every clip gets its own pick, and keeps it when it is re-rendered. New moods are available too: epic, suspense, emotional, cinematic and world. Everything shipped is public domain (CC0) or our own original, and the packaging check refuses any file without a recorded licence. Set `ASSET_VARIANTS=off` for the old one-file-per-mood behaviour. ([#TBD](https://github.com/FujiwaraChoki/supoclip/pulls))
